{"cause":"Independent review found that the first draft allowed Adapter tests in a networked plane and also mixed or under-versioned the B0 ABI, evidence, admission, Notebook execution approval, native migration, and memory scope boundaries.","cause_status":"known","event_id":"803b8557-a075-4239-8fa3-0bc0caf47ced","event_sha256":"dfccdadfe028d518144f0751ab8669d600a08bed29b08178da78e7f8cdeacadc","evidence":{"kind":"review","observed_at":"2026-07-25T22:54:14.000Z","ref":"docs/superpowers/specs/v1.8.3/capability-factory-design.md","sha256":"0810ba527e44e8a90b503e34013540251b292a7f17a62c9dc456e0b8eb0959ea"},"impact":"The design required a second architecture pass before it could be treated as the v1.8.3 scope.","incident_id":"8426b43a-9e94-4a37-86c0-d5f258ab00db","lesson":"Separate network fetch from all untrusted execution, preserve the frozen B0 ABI, and version every cross-layer binding or execution approval instead of relying on implied state.","lesson_key":"capability-factory-cross-layer-separation","links":["docs/superpowers/specs/v1.8.3/README.md","docs/superpowers/specs/v1.8.3/capability-factory-design.md","docs/superpowers/specs/v1.8.3/domain-memory-design.md","docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-25-model-custom-contract-design.md","docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-23-v1.8.1-graph-first-notebook-projection-design.md"],"prev_event_sha256":"34d262b7bcb7fba2a96c76bdbf82c3dbb2236de0b7dea5baffa081a5dc1763c1","preventability":"partially_preventable","resolution":"resolved","review_round":1,"schema_version":1,"severity":"high","stage":"design","subtype":"changes_required","timestamp":"2026-07-25T22:54:14.000Z","type":"REVIEW"}
